---
<GuideLayout title="MW4 DMZ Keys List" lang="zh-CN">
  <div slot="definition">
    <p><strong>Last verified:</strong> <time datetime="2026-10-24">2026-10-24</time>（Asia/Shanghai）</p>
    <p><strong>Status legend:</strong> <code>confirmed</code>（官方点名，或 ≥2 一手工具站钥名一致；仅 Key name） / <code>reported</code>（社区 / 单站 / 钥名未 confirmed；或 Opens 开法摘要，不得当门址定论）。</p>
    <p><strong>Fields:</strong> Key name · Location / POI · Grid (approx.) · Opens / use · Status · Last verified · Sources</p>
    <p><strong>硬规则：</strong> Location / Grid 官方与本拍均未钉死 → 留空（机制类型行用 —）。Opens 社区摘要最多 <code>reported</code>，不得升格 <code>confirmed</code>。</p>
    <p>本表收录 MW4 DMZ <strong>钥匙（Keys）</strong>：名称、用途摘要与核实状态。</p>
    <p>钥匙是 Stash 可存物品类型之一；Lieutenant 可掉落通往其个人锁定点的特殊钥匙。</p>
    <p><strong>具体哪座门 / Grid</strong> 官方无逐钥表 → Location / Grid 留空。</p>
    <p>社区工具站交叉仅用于 <strong>钥名存在性</strong>；开法细节标 <code>reported</code> 或留空。</p>
  </div>
  <div slot="how-to">
    <ol>
      <li><strong>默认排序：</strong> 先机制 / kit，再 Key name A→Z；静态表 + 轻量筛选。</li>
      <li><strong>筛选项：</strong> Key name · Status（也可选择其他列筛选 Opens 摘要等文字）。</li>
      <li><code>Status=confirmed</code>：<strong>只保证 Key name</strong>；读 Opens 时若有文字，一律按 <code>reported</code> 线索。</li>
      <li>别名见页脚「命名别名」；<strong>勿拆两行</strong>。</li>
      <li>回 <a href="/dmz-mw4/">/dmz-mw4</a>。</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
  <div slot="body">
    <p><strong>筛选项：</strong> Key name · Location / POI · Grid (approx.) · Opens / use · Status</p>
    <p>P0 机制 / kit 5 行 + P1 多源交叉钥名 32 行 + P2 整行 <code>reported</code> 2 行，共 39 行。<code>confirmed（Key name）</code> 仅表示钥名存在性；Location / Grid 留空，Opens 社区开法摘要最多为 <code>reported</code>。</p>
    <FilterableTable
      columns={["Key name", "Location / POI", "Grid (approx.)", "Opens / use", "Status", "Last verified", "Sources"]}
      caption="MW4 DMZ Keys List — 39 行（P0 5 + P1 32 + P2 2）"
      id="mw4-dmz-keys"
      rows={sortedRows}
      isTemplate={false}
      note={"Last verified: 2026-10-24。Status=confirmed 只保证 Key name；Location / Grid 留空（机制类型行用 —）。Opens 社区摘要一律按 reported 线索，不升格 confirmed；P2 两行整行 reported。"}
    />
    <p><small><strong>命名别名：</strong> Coin Mining Den ↔ Coin Mining Den Key；Supreme Leader's Bunker Access Card ↔ Supreme Leader Access Card；Roze's Highrise Armory ↔ Roze's High-Rise Armory；Rail Depot Storage ↔ Train Depot Storageroom。别名勿拆两行。Police Station Key vs Police Station Armory：关系未确认，勿合并；Police Station Armory 不进表。</small></p>
  </div>
  <div slot="sources">
    <div class="table-scroll">
      <table>
        <caption>Sources and update dates</caption>
        <thead><tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Source</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Notes</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr id="source-1"><td>1</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-dmz-how-to-play-forward-operating-base-guide">DMZ Deep Dive, Part 2: FOB Full Intel Guide</a></td><td>October 09, 2026；本窗口径 2026-10-24</td><td>Keys∈Stash；Lieutenant special key</td></tr>
          <tr id="source-2"><td>2</td><td><a href="https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/10/call-of-duty-modern-warfare-4-ready-for-launch-progression-prestige">Ready for Launch: Progression and Prestige</a></td><td>October 19, 2026；本窗口径 2026-10-24</td><td>Appendix 点名 3 kit 钥</td></tr>
          <tr id="source-3"><td>3</td><td><a href="https://dmzmap.com/keys">DMZMap · Keys</a></td><td>Last updated Oct 23, 2026；本窗 curl 2026-10-24</td><td>一手工具站；confirmed / player-report 分段</td></tr>
          <tr id="source-4"><td>4</td><td><a href="https://mw4map.com/keys">MW4 Map · Keys</a></td><td>Checked Oct 22, 2026；本窗 curl 2026-10-24</td><td>一手工具站；confirmed / kit / reported</td></tr>
          <tr id="source-5"><td>5</td><td><a href="https://dmzcodex.com/keys">DMZ Codex · Keys</a></td><td>UPDATED 24 Oct 2026；本窗 curl 2026-10-24</td><td>一手工具站；含 community / unverified</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p><code>confirmed</code>（Key name） · <code>reported</code>（Opens / P2） · <strong>Last verified:</strong> <time datetime="2026-10-24">2026-10-24</time> · Sources: <a href="#source-1">[1]</a><a href="#source-2">[2]</a><a href="#source-3">[3]</a><a href="#source-4">[4]</a><a href="#source-5">[5]</a></p>
  </div>
</GuideLayout>
